Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Previously on Grey's Anatomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}前情提要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.58,0:00:03.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've had this thing for my roommate,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.58,0:00:03.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一开始就对我的室友
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:06.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}since like day one and I just... I can't tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:06.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有好感 但我不敢告诉她
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.33,0:00:09.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wouldn't it be easier to just ask her out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.33,0:00:09.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}直接约她出去不是比较简单吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:12.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you really as shallow and callous as you seem?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:12.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真如外表看上去那么肤浅无情吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.54,0:00:15.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you want to go out for a drink later
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.54,0:00:16.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你等下想去喝一杯 听我诉苦吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:16.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and hear about my secret pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:18.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't. I'm seeing someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:18.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 我有对象了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:19.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Save yourself the misery man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:19.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你别自讨苦吃了 老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.92,0:00:22.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- She's off the market. - What? But she's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.92,0:00:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 她已经名花有主了 - 什么？不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:24.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If she was seeing someone, I live with her, I would know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:24.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若她有约会对象 身为她室友 我一定会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:27.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And the longer this little fling goes on,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:27.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你们越来越纠缠不清
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:30.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the more favors you get over the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:30.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就会比别人得到更多偏袒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.42,0:00:33.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}who are fighting tooth and nail just to make it through this program.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.42,0:00:33.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们可是拼尽全力想完成实习
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:36.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When those people start finding out what's going on...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:36.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等那些人发现了你们的事情…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:38.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is this that we're doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:38.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们这样到底算什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:40.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You need a definition?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:40.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想要确定关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.46,0:00:43.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The next time I see you favoring Meredith Grey in any way,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.46,0:00:43.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}下次再让我看见 你有任何偏心梅若迪丝葛蕾的行为
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:46.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll make sure she doesn't see the inside of an OR for a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:46.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就让她一个月都进不了手术室
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:54.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, anyone who says you can sleep when you die,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:54.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是谁说死了以后就能睡个饱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.92,0:00:58.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}tell them to come talk to me after a few months as an intern.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.92,0:00:58.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}叫他们先当几个月的实习医生 再来找我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:03.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course, it's not just the job that keeps us up all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:03.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然 我们熬夜 不一定都是因为工作
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:05.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have to get up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:05.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得起床了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? My God, what time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？天啊 几点了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.71,0:01:15.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's 5:20, and I have pre-rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.71,0:01:15.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凌晨5点20分 我要做预备巡房
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:18.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you have to leave before they see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:18.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得快离开 以免被他们撞见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.79,0:01:22.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, come on, now. Why don't you just let them see?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.79,0:01:22.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 你干嘛不让他们看？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:24.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No! - Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:24.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不要！ - 拜托！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.04,0:01:27.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You get any sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.04,0:01:27.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有睡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.83,0:01:31.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She could oil the bedsprings as a courtesy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.83,0:01:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她应该尽屋主之谊 帮床垫弹簧上油
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:33.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or at least buy a padded headboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或者至少买个有软垫的床头板
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.33,0:01:36.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So who's the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.33,0:01:36.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那男的是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:38.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You think it was just one guy doing all that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:38.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得床上只有一个男人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:40.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you mind if I don't think about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:40.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 可否别让我去想那个？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.62,0:01:42.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.62,0:01:43.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 羡慕吗？ - 我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:43.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.42,0:01:46.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am. But at least I know she'll be having a long day at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.42,0:01:46.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就很羡慕 但至少我知道 今天她有得累了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.71,0:02:03.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, at least we know brain surgery isn't his only skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.71,0:02:03.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至少我们知道他不只擅长脑部手术
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.83,0:02:05.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They can't be... He's her boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.83,0:02:05.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行…他是她上司
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:07.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:07.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:08.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's all of our boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:08.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是我们所有人的上司
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.29,0:02:12.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She has been scrubbing in a lot lately on his surgeries.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.29,0:02:12.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她最近的确常去他执刀的手术实习
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.00,0:02:15.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, Meredith wouldn't sleep with him just to... No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.00,0:02:15.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝绝对不会这样就跟他上床
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.46,0:02:17.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If she's not ashamed, why is it a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.46,0:02:17.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她没有觉得见不得人的话 干嘛不公开？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.92,0:02:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe she didn't. Maybe it just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.92,0:02:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许她没有隐瞒 可能是一时兴起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:24.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, spontaneously, last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:24.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}昨晚临时起意的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.58,0:02:27.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi. Good morning. - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.58,0:02:27.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 早上好 - 早
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.96,0:02:31.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, it sounded like you were having pretty radical sex last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.96,0:02:31.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听上去你昨晚在床上挺激烈的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:32.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}all night long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:32.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}彻夜没睡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.25,0:02:34.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who was the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.25,0:02:34.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对象是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.50,0:02:35.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No one you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.50,0:02:35.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们不认识
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.33,0:02:38.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're late. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.33,0:02:38.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要迟到了 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.46,0:02:40.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, if life's so hard already,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.46,0:02:40.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是人生这么困难
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.79,0:02:43.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}why do we bring more trouble down on ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.79,0:02:43.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们干嘛去惹更多麻烦？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:46.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's up with the need to hit the self-destruct button?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:46.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们干嘛非得把自己搞垮？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.25,0:02:49.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yikes, wouldn't want to meet you in a dark alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.25,0:02:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这样子会令人避之唯恐不及
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right back at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.21,0:02:51.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A run? You run?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.21,0:02:51.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}慢跑？你会慢跑？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:53.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every day, babe, every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:53.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宝贝 我每天都跑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:55.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not suffering enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:55.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吃的苦不够多吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.21,0:02:57.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What doesn't kill you, makes you stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.21,0:02:57.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我越挫越勇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.54,0:02:59.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't go acting all indefatigable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.54,0:02:59.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别一副铁人的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.33,0:03:01.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're dragging like the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.33,0:03:01.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟我们一样累得半死
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.21,0:03:04.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, what is that, professional weakness, Dr. Yang?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.21,0:03:04.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么搞的 我们的杨医生变柔弱了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.21,0:03:06.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It's called the flu. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.21,0:03:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 这叫流感 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:09.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I need a major rush to make it through this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:09.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得好好提振精神 才能撑过今天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.33,0:03:11.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I need a kick-ass surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.33,0:03:11.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我需要一场超厉害手术
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.17,0:03:13.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You a bad boy last night, George?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.17,0:03:13.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你昨晚使坏了吗 乔治？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:15.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That would be Meredith.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:15.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是梅若迪丝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.79,0:03:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You a bad boy, Meredith?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.79,0:03:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你使坏了吗 梅若迪丝？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.25,0:03:19.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.25,0:03:19.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}愿闻其详
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.54,0:03:20.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.54,0:03:20.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么好说的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.71,0:03:22.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That says it all, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.71,0:03:22.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一切尽在不言中啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:25.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry, I have a sex life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:25.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 我有性生活
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.50,0:03:27.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't apologize. Embrace it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.50,0:03:27.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别道歉 大方承认
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.79,0:03:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Share it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.79,0:03:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一起分享
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.25,0:03:30.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Count me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.25,0:03:30.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我加入
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:34.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, next time, just let me know if I need to go to a hotel
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:34.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}下次先知会我 以免我需要去住旅馆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.21,0:03:35.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so I can get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.21,0:03:35.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才能睡顿好觉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:37.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}IV nurse, ICU.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:37.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}护士 重症监护室需要点滴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.58,0:03:40.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Am I missing something? - You were just a little loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.58,0:03:40.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我错过什么了吗？ - 你有点太大声了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.58,0:03:46.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do they know it's McDreamy keeping them up all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.58,0:03:46.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们知道是美梦医生 让你整晚没睡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.46,0:03:48.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.46,0:03:48.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但愿他们不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:50.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I already have Bailey riding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:50.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}已经有贝利在找我麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:53.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't need my roommates thinking I'm getting special treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:53.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不需要让室友认为我有特殊待遇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.21,0:03:59.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}O'Malley, Yang, Karev, go on to clinic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.21,0:03:59.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欧麦利、杨、卡瑞 去门诊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:03.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}O'Malley, patients are waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:03.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欧麦利 病患在等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.88,0:04:05.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You two come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.88,0:04:05.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们俩跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.50,0:04:07.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lzzie, you're hanging with me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.50,0:04:07.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伊兹 你今天要跟着我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:10.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Good morning, Dr. Shepherd. - Dr. Bailey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:10.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 早上好 薛波医生 - 贝利医生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:15.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Late night, Grey?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:15.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}葛蕾 昨晚熬夜了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:18.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, caffeine just hasn't kicked in yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:18.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有 只是咖啡因还没起效
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:22.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you're at all religious, you want to start praying it kicks in soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:22.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你若信教 最好祈祷赶快起效
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:23.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's a consult in the pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:23.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}急诊有位病患在等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:25.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Girl with a fever and abdominal pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:25.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个女孩发烧又腹痛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:28.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}After that, Nicholas in 3311 needs his meds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:28.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后3311号病房的尼可拉斯 需要吃药
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:31.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Moeller's IV fell out, and he's a hard stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:31.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫勒先生的点滴针头掉了 他的静脉很难找
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.71,0:04:36.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Post-ops in 1337, 3342, 3363 and 2381.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.71,0:04:36.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}1337、3342、3363 和2381号病房需要做术后追踪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:38.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Three-eighty-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:38.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}3…8…1
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.12,0:04:42.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}3342, 3363
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.12,0:04:42.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}3342、3363
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.83,0:04:45.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and 23...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.83,0:04:45.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有23…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:48.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why are you still standing in front of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么还在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.04,0:04:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You look more like me than you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.04,0:04:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的表情跟我真像
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:53.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What's the matter? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:53.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 怎么了吗？ - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.67,0:04:55.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Help! I need immediate help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.67,0:04:55.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}救命！来人帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.67,0:04:56.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.67,0:04:56.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有什么问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:04:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My damn boyfriend swallowed my keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:04:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的死男友吞了我的钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:05:01.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't want her to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:05:01.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想让她离开
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:05.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Locate the lady's keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:05.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}找出这位女士钥匙所在的部位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.50,0:05:08.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think she got some bug on her trip to Mexico with her friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.50,0:05:08.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她应该是跟朋友去墨西哥时染上的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.08,0:05:11.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I told her not to go to a Third-World country,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.08,0:05:11.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我早叫她别去第三世界国家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:12.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but does she ever listen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:12.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但她听过我的话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:15.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's been weak ever since, and she's lost weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:15.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她回来以后身体就很虚弱 体重也掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:17.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:17.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没掉多少
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.25,0:05:19.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And this morning, she passed out in the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.25,0:05:19.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今早她洗澡时晕倒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:21.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When was the trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:21.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么时候去的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:24.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A couple weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:24.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两个礼拜前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:26.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm really fine. I just have a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:26.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的没事 只是发烧而已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.67,0:05:30.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, well, will you lie back for an exam for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.67,0:05:30.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我要检查一下 能不能请你躺下？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.96,0:05:33.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, please, I don't need an exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.96,0:05:33.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的不必了 我不需要检查
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:36.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just give me some antibiotics and send me home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:36.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开点抗生素给我 让我回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:38.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, maybe it is just a fever,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:38.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许只是发烧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:40.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but they called down for a surgeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:40.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他们叫医生来检查
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.29,0:05:42.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so I have to give the OK to let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.29,0:05:42.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以要我放行 你才能走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.08,0:05:45.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, just let me do the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.08,0:05:45.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乖乖让我检查吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.75,0:05:49.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.75,0:05:49.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让她检查吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:51.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:51.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.79,0:05:54.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is crazy. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.79,0:05:54.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太夸张了 我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For God's sake, Claire, I don't want to spend my entire day here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 克蕾儿 我不想在这里耗整天
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.12,0:06:01.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, actually, Mrs. Rice,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.12,0:06:01.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱斯太太 其实啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.83,0:06:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}this might be easier if we had some privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.83,0:06:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我们独处一下可能更简单
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:07.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So would you two mind leaving the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:07.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们介意先回避一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.12,0:06:09.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.12,0:06:09.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:16.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Digby. Digby Owens. I have an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:16.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}迪比欧文斯 我预约过了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:21.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, sir, uh, you're bleeding. You mind if I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:21.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先生 不好意思 你在流血 介意让我…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:23.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure, sure. Have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:23.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然好 请便
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:26.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- That's a gunshot. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:26.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 那是枪伤 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.71,0:06:29.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We got a gunshot wound. We got to get him down to the pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.71,0:06:29.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人中枪 得送他去急诊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.62,0:06:31.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sit, Mr...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.62,0:06:31.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请坐 怎么称呼…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:32.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh... Digby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:32.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}迪比
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.92,0:06:34.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, but it isn't an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.92,0:06:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 但这不是急诊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I scheduled it. - What, the gunshot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我预约过了 - 什么 枪伤吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:38.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. My buddy shot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:38.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我朋友对我开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.33,0:06:40.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Buddy? - Yeah, just as a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.33,0:06:40.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 朋友？ - 对 算帮我的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:41.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- On purpose? - Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:41.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 这是刻意的？ - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.62,0:06:43.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He wasn't trying to hurt me, but you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.62,0:06:43.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他对我没恶意 但…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.79,0:06:46.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- But why? - I like the scars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.79,0:06:46.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 为什么？ - 我喜欢伤疤
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:11.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}实习医生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.38,0:07:20.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, everyone in town has tats, but my art is about commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.38,0:07:18.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里大家都有刺青
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.29,0:07:20.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我为了艺术绝无保留
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:22.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, this your art, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:22.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以这是你的作品？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.38,0:07:23.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.38,0:07:23.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一点也没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:26.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Damn stupid. The bullet went all the way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:26.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蠢到极点 子弹穿过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.50,0:07:28.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bounced off my ribs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.50,0:07:28.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还弹到我的肋骨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.25,0:07:30.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have another one still in my shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.25,0:07:30.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我肩膀里还有一颗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.79,0:07:32.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.79,0:07:32.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不赖吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.21,0:07:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You could hang it in the Louvre.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.21,0:07:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是旷世巨作啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:36.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have an ethos.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:36.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有自己的信仰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.92,0:07:40.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why do anything unless you're willing to go one step further than anybody else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.92,0:07:40.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凡事要做就要比别人更拼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.08,0:07:42.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What doesn't kill you makes you stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.08,0:07:42.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}人越挫越勇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:45.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Exactly. And pain is the great divide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:45.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 克服痛苦方能成功
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:48.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My coach used to say, it's all about how we process pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:48.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我教练常说 全看你怎么消化痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Football?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:50.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}美式足球？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:51.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wrestling, Iowa State.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:51.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摔角 爱荷华州立大学
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.83,0:07:53.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Iowa, 141.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.83,0:07:53.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爱荷华大学 64公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One-fifty-seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}71公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:56.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You got to be more than 180 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:56.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你现在超过81公斤了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.75,0:07:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd like to see you get back under 145.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.75,0:07:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我倒想看你瘦回66公斤以下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:01.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, but thinking of you men in tights
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:01.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思 但想到穿男人紧身衣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.75,0:08:04.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}makes me want to... puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.75,0:08:04.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就让我想…吐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.21,0:08:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's a flu going around the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.21,0:08:07.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}医院有流感流行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.33,0:08:08.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Somewhat ironic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.33,0:08:08.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有点讽刺
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.75,0:08:12.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:15.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't push so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别太用力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:21.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you lift your shirt so I can examine your stomach?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:21.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请你把衣服掀起来 让我检查一下腹部
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.33,0:08:44.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where did you get these?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.33,0:08:44.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎会有这些疤痕？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.75,0:08:50.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Claire...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.75,0:08:50.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克蕾儿…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.50,0:08:53.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you've had surgery recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.50,0:08:53.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你最近刚开过刀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:55.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}These scars are still pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:55.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}疤看上去很新
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:57.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't tell my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:57.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别告诉我爸妈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.75,0:09:01.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You did this in Mexico so your parents wouldn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.75,0:09:01.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为了不让爸妈知道 你才在墨西哥动手术吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:05.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did you have done?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:05.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你动了什么手术？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.50,0:09:14.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you noticed her foot twitching?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.50,0:09:14.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们大概三个月前…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:17.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Come on, Jamie. - My foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:17.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 这边 洁米 - 我的脚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:19.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah. About three months ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:19.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 注意到她脚在痉挛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:20.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:20.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}症状很轻
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.42,0:09:23.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We took her to County Hospital, and she got the CT scan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.42,0:09:23.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们带她去郡立医院照过电脑断层
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:24.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}which showed her...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:24.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结果显示她…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.54,0:09:26.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Brain abnormality. Here, you can put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.54,0:09:26.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}脑部异常 你可以写在这…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:29.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- And the twitching has gotten worse? - A lot worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:29.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 然后痉挛的状况恶化了？ - 大幅恶化
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They don't have the proper equipment back home to figure out what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们那边的医院设备 没办法诊断出她的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.04,0:09:36.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You did a... you did a good thing. - Show Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.04,0:09:36.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你们…做得很好 - 给妈妈看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.42,0:09:38.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yes, your mommy. - Show Mommy and Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.42,0:09:38.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对 你妈妈 - 给妈妈和爸爸看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.71,0:09:41.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, you did a good thing by coming all this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.71,0:09:41.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}幸好你们跑了这一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.75,0:09:43.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. And Mrs. Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.75,0:09:43.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}海斯夫妇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.25,0:09:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You sit tight, Jamie, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.25,0:09:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}洁米 别乱跑哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:47.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna bring Dr. Shepherd to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:47.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要请薛波医生来看你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.17,0:09:50.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- OK? Dr. Shepherd. OK? - Dr. Shepherd.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.17,0:09:50.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好吗 薛波哦？ - 薛波医生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:51.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's the brain specialist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:51.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是脑科专家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:53.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mommy and Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:53.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈妈和爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.75,0:09:57.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doctor? Is he good, this Dr. Shepherd?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.75,0:09:57.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}医生？薛波医生厉害吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.46,0:09:59.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At just about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.46,0:09:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}几乎没有他不擅长的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:04.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I assume the lady needs her keys
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:04.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我猜这位女士需要她的钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:06.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to leave this guy's sorry ass behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:06.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}离开这个烂人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:09.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah. - Well, help her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:09.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对 - 帮她一把
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.79,0:10:11.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He needs a bronchoscopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.79,0:10:11.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他需要做支气管镜检查
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:12.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See one, do one, teach one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:12.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}观摩、实操、教学
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.79,0:10:14.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've seen one. It's time to do one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.79,0:10:14.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你观摩过了 也该实地操作了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.83,0:10:17.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Alone? Seriously? Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.83,0:10:17.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一个人？真的吗？谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.79,0:10:19.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, the vote of confidence in my skills and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.79,0:10:19.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你竟然愿意相信我的技术
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:22.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't think anyone was noticing how hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:22.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没想到有人注意到我有多辛苦…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.04,0:10:23.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Izzie? Go. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.04,0:10:23.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 伊兹？快去 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:25.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You paged? - Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:25.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你呼叫我？ - 情况如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.83,0:10:29.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I did the consult, did the IV, the meds, the postops, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.83,0:10:29.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}急诊看了、点滴打了 药喂了、术后追踪做完了 都好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.04,0:10:29.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How is your pit patient?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.04,0:10:29.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}急诊病患怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:32.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's febrile and has peritoneal signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:32.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她发高烧 腹部还会疼痛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.33,0:10:33.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You all right, Dr. Yang?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.33,0:10:33.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没事吧 杨医生？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.58,0:10:36.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. On my way back to clinic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.58,0:10:36.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事 我正要回去门诊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.42,0:10:40.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think she had some sort of illegal surgery done in Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.42,0:10:40.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为她在墨西哥动了非法手术
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.25,0:10:41.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Botched abortion?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.25,0:10:41.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拙劣的堕胎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:44.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She has four laparoscopic scars on her abdomen
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她腹部有四道腹腔镜留下的疤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:46.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and won't say what they're from, the parents are clueless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:46.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}却不肯说她动了什么手术 父母也一问三不知
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:49.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- She's a minor. - Seventeen. Freshman in college.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 她未成年 - 17岁 刚上大学
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You order up for a CT? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 安排她做照电脑断层了吗？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:52.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So while she's there,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:52.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}趁她照电脑断层时
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:54.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the nurses couldn't get a Foley on Mr. Garay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:54.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}护士插不好葛莱先生的导尿管
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:57.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He may need a Coude cath if you can't get a normal one in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:57.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}普通的若插不进去 你就帮他插单弯导管
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:10:59.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Write up post-op notes on all surgical-floor patients
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:10:59.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}写下外科病房的术后追踪报告 对象包括所有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:01.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that had surgery within the last 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:01.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}24小时内动过手术的病患
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:05.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Be sure to document their EKGs and x-rays.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:05.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}务必完整记录心电图和X光片
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.17,0:11:06.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hunt them down if you can't find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.17,0:11:06.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有缺漏就尽力找齐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:08.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:08.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马上去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.46,0:11:10.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.46,0:11:10.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.25,0:11:13.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:14.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Got the flu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:14.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你染上流感了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.79,0:11:16.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, and thanks for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.79,0:11:16.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 谢谢关心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.21,0:11:17.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's making my life so much easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.21,0:11:17.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我的人生轻松多了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.29,0:11:20.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't give it to you. It's all over the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.29,0:11:20.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是我传染给你的 医院到处都有人染上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.00,0:11:22.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You should be in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.00,0:11:22.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该在家休息
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.83,0:11:25.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Disease, diagnosis and prescription from one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.83,0:11:25.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个人包办传染、诊断和开药单
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.17,0:11:27.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seriously, I'll give you a ride home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.17,0:11:27.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很认真 我可以载你回家
