Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:31.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We are going to insert a chest tube to drain
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要插一根胸管
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.08,0:18:32.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the blood, then re-inflate your lung.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.08,0:18:32.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}引流积血 重新替肺充气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:37.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, please... tell me I get to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:37.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托…让我观摩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.08,0:18:46.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Man, Iowa-style.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.08,0:18:46.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 爱荷华赞啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:51.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Before you guys start, I know you're mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:51.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在你们开口前 我知道你们很气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.33,0:18:54.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Disbelief, Claire, just disbelief.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.33,0:18:54.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是难以置信 克蕾儿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.62,0:18:56.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.62,0:18:56.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是担心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.33,0:18:58.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where did you get the idea to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.33,0:18:58.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么会有这种想法？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:18:59.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:18:59.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}网上查的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:03.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, there is a healthy way to lose weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:03.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的 要减重有健康的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.25,0:19:08.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I tried that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.25,0:19:08.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我试过了 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:11.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It doesn't work for me like it does for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:11.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对我的效果没有像你那么好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:15.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you don't need to lose weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:15.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 你不必减重
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.21,0:19:16.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.21,0:19:16.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你都吃什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.58,0:19:18.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And how much have you been working out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.58,0:19:18.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你常健身吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.75,0:19:21.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Most of the time, when people hit their target weight,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.75,0:19:21.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大多时候 人们达到目标体重后
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.17,0:19:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}they have to work to stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.17,0:19:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}必须努力才能保持
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everyone gains weight in college, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈 谁上大学不变胖的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.08,0:19:29.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's... it's stressful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.08,0:19:29.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}压力…很大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.92,0:19:34.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's... there's not enough time for exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.92,0:19:34.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没空…去运动嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.71,0:19:40.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just thought if I wasn't worried about my diet, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.71,0:19:40.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想说不用注意要吃什么的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.79,0:19:43.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could focus more on my studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.79,0:19:43.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就能专心念书
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:45.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you took yet another shortcut?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:45.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你又走捷径？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.29,0:19:48.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Life doesn't work that way, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.29,0:19:48.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样是行不通的 克蕾儿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:49.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tina!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:49.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蒂娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:50.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? You want to argue this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:50.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎样？你要跟我吵吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.54,0:19:54.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She has so much potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.54,0:19:54.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她很有潜力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.12,0:19:56.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- If she would just apply herself... - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.12,0:19:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}前提是她愿意督促自己…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.04,0:20:00.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, I think we should focus on taking care of your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.04,0:20:00.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 我们应该专注在照顾你女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.29,0:20:03.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, Claire, your parents agree,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.29,0:20:03.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克蕾儿 你父母也同意
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.67,0:20:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the best thing to do is to reverse the bypass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.67,0:20:07.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最佳选择就是动胃绕道逆转手术
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.17,0:20:08.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.17,0:20:08.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:10.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it's my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:10.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我的身体！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.42,0:20:13.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I do not want surgery again. Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.42,0:20:13.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想再动手术 拜托？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.25,0:20:16.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are serious complications.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.25,0:20:16.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有些很严重的并发症
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.79,0:20:18.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And this is about your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.79,0:20:18.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事关你的健康
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.83,0:20:20.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I'd rather be thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.83,0:20:20.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我宁愿一直纤廋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:22.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I'm afraid the choice isn't up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恐怕这由不得你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:38.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's called Rasmussen's encephalitis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:38.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这病叫拉氏脑炎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:41.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What it amounts to is that this side of her brain...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:41.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}意思就是这边的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.08,0:20:43.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This part's healthy, working perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.08,0:20:43.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这半是正常的 正常运作中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.04,0:20:47.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This black part of the brain, this... all of that is dead, or dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.04,0:20:47.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但黑色部分的脑部… 功能都已丧失 或是丧失中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.25,0:20:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The condition has gotten radically worse
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.25,0:20:50.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自她三个月前照的电脑断层后
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:52.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}since her CT scans three months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:52.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}情况严重恶化
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.62,0:20:55.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Left untreated, the disease is gonna kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.62,0:20:55.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不治疗的话 这病会要了她的命
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.79,0:20:58.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.79,0:20:58.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有多快？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.38,0:20:59.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.38,0:20:59.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.62,0:21:02.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So is there a cure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.62,0:21:02.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那有办法治疗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.88,0:21:05.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The treatment requires the diseased portion of her brain
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.88,0:21:05.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有 要治疗就必须摘除染病的脑组织
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.38,0:21:06.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}be removed and sealed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.38,0:21:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后再缝合
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.42,0:21:08.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.42,0:21:08.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但最后
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.42,0:21:10.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the spinal fluid will fill the cavity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.42,0:21:10.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}脊髓液会填满脑室
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.33,0:21:13.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remove? But, I mean, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.33,0:21:13.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摘除？但那可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Half her brain, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一半的脑 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.50,0:21:25.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Half her brain. That...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.50,0:21:25.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一半的脑 看上去…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.04,0:21:27.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}seems impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.04,0:21:27.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像是天方夜谭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.54,0:21:29.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Her age makes it possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.54,0:21:29.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多亏她年纪还小
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.75,0:21:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Her brain's not fully developed,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.75,0:21:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的脑还没完全发育
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.00,0:21:34.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so the remaining neurons will compensate for all the loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.00,0:21:34.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以剩余的神经元会补足损失
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.17,0:21:36.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But will she be normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.17,0:21:36.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但她会跟正常人一样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.92,0:21:38.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are risks to any surgery,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.92,0:21:38.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}任何手术都有风险
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.21,0:21:40.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and this is, you know, a major one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.21,0:21:40.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这又是一个大手术
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.58,0:21:42.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But if we're successful,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.58,0:21:42.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但若我们成功
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.54,0:21:44.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Jamie could walk out of this hospital in a couple weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.54,0:21:44.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}洁米几周后就能出院
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.54,0:21:46.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}go on to live a relatively normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.54,0:21:46.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}继续过相对正常的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.42,0:21:48.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I know this is a lot to digest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.42,0:21:48.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道信息量很大
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The important thing is we can save her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}重要的是记住我们可以救她一命
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.38,0:21:51.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.38,0:21:51.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.58,0:21:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Dr. O'Malley? - Yes? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.58,0:21:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 欧麦利医生？ - 是？怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.17,0:21:56.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am sorry to bother you, but if the parents consent,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.17,0:21:56.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打扰一下 若家长同意的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.42,0:21:58.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought you'd like to scrub in on the hemispherectomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.42,0:21:58.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该会想进手术室 观摩大脑半球切除术
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.46,0:22:00.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you in, or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.46,0:22:00.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要不要加入？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.04,0:22:04.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.04,0:22:04.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.67,0:22:13.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.67,0:22:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}杨 我能去观摩 薛波的大脑半球切除术
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.12,0:22:16.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm scrubbing in on a hemispherectomy with Shepherd.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.42,0:22:18.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get out! I would kill for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.42,0:22:18.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的假的！我超想去的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.17,0:22:21.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're gonna cut out half a girl's brain, and it's going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.17,0:22:21.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要切除一位小女孩的半边大脑 而且会成功
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.21,0:22:23.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's outrageous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.21,0:22:23.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}超夸张的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.29,0:22:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Almost makes it hard to hate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.29,0:22:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}差点让我不想讨厌他了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.46,0:22:28.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Why do you hate him? - Oh, no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.46,0:22:28.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你为什么讨厌他？ - 没有原因
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.25,0:22:30.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know about him and Meredith?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.25,0:22:30.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道他跟梅若迪丝的事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.50,0:22:32.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.50,0:22:32.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道？
