Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.00,0:22:41.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- And you didn't tell us? - Ooh, you're a gossip, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.00,0:22:41.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你没有告诉我们？ - 你很爱八卦？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.96,0:22:43.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I am not! - I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.96,0:22:43.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 才没有！ - 我爱
