Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.88,0:30:15.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}外科医生真是份好工作啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.00,0:30:17.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.00,0:30:17.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}报应
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.12,0:30:19.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What does karma have to do with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.12,0:30:19.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这跟报应有什么关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.42,0:30:22.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just saying, you've been given all the best surgeries,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.42,0:30:22.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是说 最好的手术都有你的份
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.25,0:30:25.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and now you smell like putrid goo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.25,0:30:25.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你现在闻起来像脓汁
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.58,0:30:27.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you're giving off a stench.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.58,0:30:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}身上还散发恶臭
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.04,0:30:28.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Karma's a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.04,0:30:28.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的是报应
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.71,0:30:31.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Shepherd needs an intern in surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.71,0:30:31.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}薛波的手术需要一个实习医生
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.71,0:30:34.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Which one of you is clear? - Dr. Bailey, where do you want me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.71,0:30:34.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 谁有空？ - 贝利医生 我要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.04,0:30:37.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You need to lie down somewhere. - I'm completely healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.04,0:30:37.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你需要去躺下 - 我没事 身体非常健康
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.75,0:30:38.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Grey?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.75,0:30:38.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}葛蕾？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.04,0:30:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Of course. - What is your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.04,0:30:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 当然啊 - 谁惹你了啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.96,0:30:43.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.96,0:30:43.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.50,0:30:46.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}'Cause apparently, you can help Dr. McDreamy
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.50,0:30:46.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你似乎有办法服务美梦医生
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.12,0:30:47.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}in ways the rest of us can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.12,0:30:47.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且我们都做不来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.29,0:30:51.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You did not just... - Yes, I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.29,0:30:51.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你不是真的… - 我就是！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.58,0:30:52.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.58,0:30:52.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.58,0:30:56.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hemispherectomy in OR 1 with Dr. Shepherd. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.58,0:30:56.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一号手术室 跟薛波医生动大脑半球切除术 快去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.96,0:31:07.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.96,0:31:07.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看上去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.92,0:31:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not the only one with hoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.92,0:31:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不只是我在刁难你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.88,0:31:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.88,0:31:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}医生
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.62,0:31:23.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Digby's post-op CBC shows a severe spike in the white blood cell count.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.62,0:31:23.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}迪比的术后血常规报告 显示白血球数突增
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.08,0:31:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.08,0:31:24.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.04,0:31:26.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's 27, with 16 percent bands.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.04,0:31:26.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}数值为27皮克 有16％的带状白血球
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.50,0:31:29.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Something else is wrong. That's a little high for simple stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.50,0:31:29.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有别的问题 以单纯的压力而言那样有点高
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.50,0:31:32.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Check for any other possible sources of infection or recent illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.50,0:31:32.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}检查其他可能感染的地方 或是近期的疾病
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.29,0:31:37.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Alright we're gonna start the procedure
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.29,0:31:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要开始动手术
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.00,0:31:39.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}with the left temporal lobectomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.00,0:31:39.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}首先要切除左颞叶
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.54,0:31:41.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks for joining us, Dr. Yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.54,0:31:41.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你来帮忙 杨医生
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.92,0:31:44.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}After the temporal, we'll do the frontal,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.92,0:31:44.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}切除颞叶后再处理额叶
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.83,0:31:46.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and then the occipital.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.83,0:31:46.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后是枕叶
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.54,0:32:01.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We were able to reverse the gastric bypass,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.54,0:32:01.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的胃绕道逆转手术成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.83,0:32:04.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but we did lose a significant portion of her bowel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.83,0:32:04.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但也失去了不少的肠道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.21,0:32:06.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And because of the short gut syndrome,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.21,0:32:06.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为短肠症候群
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.12,0:32:08.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Claire will never eat normally again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.12,0:32:08.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克蕾儿再也没办法正常饮食
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.75,0:32:12.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, wait, do... How do we help her here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.75,0:32:12.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下…我们该怎么帮她？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.00,0:32:16.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, getting proper nutrition will be a lifelong problem for Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.00,0:32:16.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克蕾儿一辈子都会有营养不良的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.17,0:32:19.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great, as if we already don't have our hands full with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.17,0:32:19.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了 好像她嫌我们还不够忙
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.25,0:32:24.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She gets good grades. She stays out of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.25,0:32:24.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她有好成绩 不惹麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.33,0:32:25.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.33,0:32:25.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她很聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.96,0:32:29.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just think she feels like nothing she does is good enough for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.96,0:32:29.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她应该只是感觉 自己永远没办法达到你的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.12,0:32:32.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you think that I'm responsible for this...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.12,0:32:32.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若你觉得这一切是我造成的…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.17,0:32:35.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think Claire is killing herself to please you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.17,0:32:35.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为克蕾儿为了讨好你连命都不要
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.71,0:32:37.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.71,0:32:37.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.12,0:32:42.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have no idea what's going on in that girl's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.12,0:32:42.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不了解那女孩的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.04,0:32:44.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.04,0:32:44.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是她妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.88,0:32:46.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She worships the ground you walk on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.88,0:32:46.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是她崇拜的偶像
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.79,0:32:50.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She didn't do this for herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.79,0:32:50.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她动手术不是为了自己
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.38,0:32:57.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think that this situation is completely...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.38,0:32:57.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为这一切夸张至极…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.00,0:32:59.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tina... shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.00,0:32:59.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蒂娜…闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.21,0:33:09.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.21,0:33:09.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.17,0:33:10.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm freezing, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.17,0:33:10.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}医生 我好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.38,0:33:12.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I-I can't stop shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.38,0:33:12.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我…抖个不停
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.04,0:33:14.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}His temp's way up, and BP's dropping, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.04,0:33:14.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他发高烧 血压还越来越低 医生
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.67,0:33:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Digby, have you had any recent illnesses, new piercings,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.67,0:33:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 迪比 你最近有没有生病 新打的洞
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.92,0:33:19.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}tattoos, wounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.92,0:33:19.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}刺青或伤口？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.25,0:33:20.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}New tat on my calf.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.25,0:33:20.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我小腿上刺了一个新的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.33,0:33:26.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.29,0:33:30.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.29,0:33:30.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.92,0:33:32.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was nowhere near that nasty this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.92,0:33:32.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今早明明没有这么恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.92,0:33:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was infected? Why didn't you say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.92,0:33:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感染了？你怎么都没说？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.21,0:33:36.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah, it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.21,0:33:36.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.46,0:33:39.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not here to complain about a little pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.46,0:33:39.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会因为一点小痛就跑来医院
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.17,0:33:43.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The infection's been exacerbated by the stress from the gunshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.17,0:33:43.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}枪伤引起的压力使感染恶化
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.54,0:33:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get him to ICU.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.54,0:33:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}带他去重症监护室
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.75,0:33:47.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll get you started on some antibiotics.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.75,0:33:47.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会帮你打抗生素
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.25,0:33:57.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}From the frontal lobectomy, I'm going to encounter a, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.25,0:33:57.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}切除完额叶后 我要处理…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.62,0:34:00.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll encounter the anterior cerebral artery.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.62,0:34:00.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要处理前大脑动脉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.42,0:34:02.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, so we're gonna need to, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.42,0:34:02.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 所以我们需要…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.17,0:34:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The branches of the artery need to be coagulated and divided.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.17,0:34:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}需要电凝并离断动脉分支
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.92,0:34:10.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, Taylor, her anesthesia's awful light.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.92,0:34:10.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}泰勒 她的麻醉好像太少了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.42,0:34:15.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, Taylor, s-she's waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.42,0:34:15.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂 泰勒 她要醒来了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.17,0:34:20.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Taylor?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.17,0:34:20.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}泰勒医生？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.33,0:34:22.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.33,0:34:22.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他睡着了！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.29,0:34:24.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Taylor!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.29,0:34:24.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}泰勒！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.67,0:34:34.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Taylor!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.67,0:34:34.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}泰勒医生！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.96,0:34:38.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Huh? Oh, God, sorry. Sorry, I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.96,0:34:38.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯？天啊 抱歉 我马上处理
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.12,0:34:41.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My bad, Shep.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.12,0:34:41.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我不好 薛波
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.79,0:34:43.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was right, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.79,0:34:43.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说对了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.17,0:34:46.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aw, I nodded off. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.17,0:34:46.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我打个盹 拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.46,0:34:48.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah whatever you got to do to get through the day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.46,0:34:48.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为了熬过一天 你不择手段吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.25,0:34:49.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Steph, get me some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.25,0:34:49.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}史黛芬 帮我拿点咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.62,0:34:50.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.62,0:34:50.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是 医生
